    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Vacant home grant available (Potentially €70,000, subject to approval)\r\n123 Fasaugh Avenue is a two bed mid terrace parlour house in the heart of Cabra. The house has a 20m south facing rear garden that provides great scope for extension to take full advantage of the bright sunny aspect. The house requires upgrading and modernisation throughout but as the property has been vacant for the required period the house potentially qualifies for the Vacant House Grant of up to ?70,000. (subject to approval). The accommodation extends to 75sqm (807sqft) and comprises an entrance hall, parlour room, reception room and kitchen on the ground floor and two double bedrooms and a shower room on the first floor. Gas fired heating. \r\nLocal facilities include a variety of excellent schools, shops, restaurants and leisure amenities. It is located within walking distance of the Phoenix Park, Botanic Gardens, TUD Grangegorman, Inspire gym & swimming pool. Local villages of Phibsborough and Stoneybatter are just a short walk away. Transport links include an excellent bus service allowing easy access for all commuters, Broombridge Train Station and the Luas. There is easy access to the N3, M50 and Dublin Airport is a 20 minute drive approx.\r\n\r\nAny intending purchaser(s) shall accept that no statement, description or measurement contained in any newspaper, brochure, magazine, advertisement, handout, website or any other document or publication, published by the vendor or by HJ Byrne Estate Agents, as the vendors agent, in respect of the premises shall constitute a representation inducing the purchaser(s) to enter into any contract for sale, or any warranty forming part of any such contract for sale. Any such statement, description or measurement, whether in writing or in oral form, given by the vendor, or by HJ Byrne Estate Agents as the vendors agent, are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact and do not form part of any contract. Any intending purchaser(s) shall satisfy themselves by inspection, survey or otherwise as to the correctness of same. No omission, misstatement, misdescription, incorrect measurement or error of any description, whether given orally or in any written form by the vendor or by HJ Byrne Estate Agents as the vendors agent, shall give rise to any claim for compensation against the vendor or against HJ Byrne Estate Agents nor any right whatsoever of rescission or otherwise of the proposed contract for sale. Any intending purchaser(s) are deemed to fully satisfy themselves in relation to all such matters. These materials are issued on the strict understanding that all negotiations will be conducted through HJ Byrne Estate Agents.\r\n\r\nServices \r\nMains services"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall (9.35ft x 5.74ft) \r\nParlour (10.01ft x 9.02ft) \r\nReception Room (14.27ft x 15.91ft) Reception room with fireplace\r\nKitchen (14.60ft x 9.35ft) Kitchen extension\r\nBedroom 1 (11.15ft x 16.08ft) Double bedroom to the front\r\nBedroom 2 (10.83ft x 9.35ft) Double bedroom to the rear\r\nShower Room (6.07ft x 4.92ft) Contemporary shower recently installed."
